.git
.github
.worktrees
docs
**/node_modules
# Package task configs are for the repo's mise, not the images: copied into an
# image (or pnpm-deployed to /deploy) they are read by the image's mise shims
# as an untrusted config and every tool call fails.
**/.mise
# …except the root config: the builder stages read the pnpm pin from it.
!.mise/config.toml
